<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ferreyros started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ferreyros started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it started coverage of Peruvian heavy machine supplier Ferreyros with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- The company is Peru's &quot;leading distributor of capital goods...(and) after falling in 1996, we expect earnings growth to spring back in 1997,&quot; the firm said in a report.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
